        <p facs="#facs_11_r_1">
          818 <persName ref="#zbz-p.2">JEANNE HERSCH</persName>
        </p>
        <p facs="#facs_11_r_2">
          En italien, cf. diverses études de <persName ref="#zbz-p.1749">NICOLA ABBAGNANO</persName>, notamment <hi rendition="#i"><bibl ref="#zbz-w.666">La struttura dell'esistenza</bibl></hi>, <placeName ref="#zbz-l.226">Turin</placeName> 1939.
        </p>
        <p facs="#facs_11_r_3">
          En 1958, <persName ref="#zbz-p.1750">ALBERTO CARACCIOLO</persName>, <hi rendition="#i"><bibl ref="#zbz-w.667">Studi Jaspersiani</bibl></hi>, <placeName ref="#zbz-l.403">Milan</placeName>, <orgName ref="#zbz-o.600">Marzorati</orgName>.
        </p>
        <p facs="#facs_11_r_4">
          En anglais, cf. <persName ref="#zbz-p.1751">ADOLPH LICHTIGFELD</persName>, <hi rendition="#i"><bibl ref="#zbz-w.668">Jaspers métaphysics</bibl></hi>, <placeName ref="#zbz-l.85">Londres</placeName> 1954, <orgName ref="#zbz-o.4">Colibri press</orgName>.
        </p>
        <p facs="#facs_11_r_5">
          En 1960, <persName ref="#zbz-p.1752">WALTER KAUFMANN</persName>, <hi rendition="#i"><bibl ref="#zbz-w.669">The owl and the nightingale, from Shakespeare to existentialism</bibl></hi>, <orgName ref="#zbz-o.601">Faber</orgName>, <placeName ref="#zbz-l.85">Londres</placeName>.
        </p>
        <p>
          En 1963, <persName ref="#zbz-p.1751">A. LICHTIGFELD</persName>, <hi rendition="#i"><bibl ref="#zbz-w.670">Aspects of Jaspers' Philosophy</bibl></hi>, <placeName ref="#zbz-l.559">Pretoria</placeName>.
        </p>
